{"version":1,"content":"<p>雖然有人好心提醒姊妹們要謹記「防火防盜防閨密」呢個道理，畢竟人心難測，但來自哥倫比亞嘅人氣脱星Ariella Ferrera就認為男友如衣服，親密程度同閨密冇得比，仲話只要好姊妹鍾意嘅話，同對方分享男友都冇問題！</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;&lt;</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T15:21:09.853234+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":113,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T15:00:53+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T15:18:16.059271+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T15:18:16.059271+00:00","content_hash":"c00e535172df60b60d311e053fbe8b90ccbad8f7662dbac519503ea57be2eccd","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}